OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep drains clear' warning as
OL,4,Aheavy rain forecast
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are being urged to keep
OL,7,Fdrains clear in a bid to prevent
OL,8,Fflooding.
OL,10,FJersey Met has forecast heavy rain with
OL,11,Fa risk of localised flooding on
OL,12,FSaturday night and Sunday and residents
OL,13,Fare being advised to remove leaves from
OL,14,Fgullies.
OL,16,FDuncan Berry, head of liquid waste for
OL,17,Finfrastructure and environment - which
OL,18,Flooks after main roads and empties
OL,19,Fgullies - said there were a number of
OL,20,Fflooding hotspots across the island,
OL,21,Fincluding La Verte Rue, St Mary.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
