OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep drains clear' warning as
OL,4,Aheavy rain forecast
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Keep your drains clear," he warned.
OL,7,F"If your property is prone to flooding
OL,8,Fyou need to try and divert the water
OL,9,Faway from your property either by using
OL,10,Fsandbags or using a floorboard or board
OL,11,Fin front of your doors."
